<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 77,200 MT were up 16 percent from the previous week, but down 18 percent from the 4-week average. The primary buyers were Mexico (26,200 MT) and Japan (23,900 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 133,700 MT were 48 percent above the week earlier and 16 percent over the 4-week average. The destinations were Israel (66,100 MT), Japan (57,900 MT), and Mexico (9,700 MT).</p>
</text>
